$comment
ERROR EXAMPLE: Basis set missing parameters for a heavy element.
PbCl2 with 6-311+G(d,p). Pople basis sets only cover up to Kr (Z=36)
in standard Q-Chem libraries — Pb (Z=82) is unsupported.
Q-Chem error: "Basis set not defined for atom" / BASIS_NOT_FOUND.
Fix: use BASIS = gen with an SDD or def2-TZVP entry for Pb (with ECP),
or switch the whole molecule to def2-TZVP.
$end

$molecule
0 1
Pb    0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
Cl    2.320000   0.700000   0.000000
Cl   -2.320000   0.700000   0.000000
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE   opt
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-311+G(d,p)
$end

@@@

$molecule
   READ
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE   freq
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-311+G(d,p)
$end
